        "map-navigation/2/5"
      ],
      "previous_text": "Four bands by default: 0 to 5, 6 to 19, 20 to 30, and above 30 percent. The colors and boundaries are yours to change.",
      "next_text": "Dragging a handle changes the boundary and saves it to your preferences."
